n May, winning numerous awards up until the present day. </span>Mahindra Klerksdorp joins the group<span style="font-weight: normal;">, soon becoming an established household name within the Klerksdorp area.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-186_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-187_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bDunJF gzxnfF pf-188_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-191_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-192_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bOQUxc quwHz pf-194_">2015</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-195_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bDunJF gzxnfF pf-196_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-199_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-200_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bOQUxc quwHz pf-202_">North West Motor Group family welcomes Nissan Standerton<span style="font-weight: normal;">, rapidly expanding their product range. Our group is recognised as one of the top 5 national brands.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-203_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-204_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bDunJF gzxnfF pf-205_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-208_"><h3 data-pf-type="Hea