-bOQUxc quwHz pf-236_">Suzuki Menlyn<span style="font-weight: normal;">, the newest kid on the block, </span>is acquired in February<span style="font-weight: normal;">. Suzuki's exposure within Pretoria and surrounds amplifies. The franchise recently broke Suzuki SA's sales record.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-237_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-238_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bDunJF gzxnfF pf-239_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-242_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-243_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bOQUxc quwHz pf-245_">2018</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-246_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bDunJF gzxnfF pf-247_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eoVZcn cepmFm pf-250_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cVzzKN eMDdXJ pf-251_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bOQUxc quwHz pf-253_">Penta Motor Group welcomes our Limpopo branches<span style="font-weight: normal;">: </span>Mahindra Polokwane, Volvo Cars Polokwane, <span style="font-weight: normal;">and </span>Mahindra Mokopane<span style="font-weight: normal;">. </span>Penta Klerksdorp <span style="font-weight: normal;">builds bigger, better premises. The group's footprint expands significantly in the Northern provinces.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-254_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Col